{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24577","headline":"夏日闲放 · 白居易","name":"夏日闲放","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"时暑不出门，亦无宾客至。\n静室深下帘，小庭新扫地。\n褰裳复岸帻，闲傲得自恣。\n朝景枕簟清，乘凉一觉睡。\n午餐何所有，鱼肉一两味。\n夏服亦无多，蕉纱三五事。\n资身既给足，长物徒烦费。\n若比箪瓢人，吾今太富贵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}